---
// CTA — large rounded brand panel with headline, copy and two buttons.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="relative isolate overflow-hidden rounded-card bg-brand-600 px-6 py-16 text-center text-white shadow-2xl shadow-brand-600/20 sm:px-16 sm:py-24">
      <img src="/media/abstract-3.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-25 mix-blend-overlay" />
      <div class="absolute -top-32 left-1/2 -z-10 h-96 w-96 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-300/40 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -right-20 -z-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-brand-900/50 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <p class="inline-flex items-center rounded-button border border-white/25 bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-white">Free for teams of up to five</p>
      <h2 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">Give your team a calmer week</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-100">Set up your first plan in ten minutes and see what work feels like without the noise.</p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/pricing" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-brand-700 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-brand-50 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-brand-600 sm:w-auto">Start free</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-button border border-white/30 px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-white/10 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white sm:w-auto">
          <span>Book a walkthrough</span>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-brand-200">No credit card. No onboarding call unless you want one.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
